# 0. YOUR MISSION

Act as a principal full-stack architect, senior geospatial engineer, institutional quantitative researcher, applied mathematician, financial data scientist, UI/UX designer, data reliability engineer and independent software testing lead.

Transform the existing WorldPulse module into a visually exceptional, fully functional, publicly accessible global financial intelligence platform.

The fundamental user experience must be:

**Explore the world → Select a country → Discover its landmarks, news and financial markets → Understand what's happening → Investigate the underlying data → Access advanced quantitative research.**

The application must support both non-technical visitors and sophisticated quantitative researchers without overwhelming either audience.

It must remain connected to the complete AlphaForge ecosystem.

This is not a request for a prototype, wireframe, decorative globe or static dashboard.

Implement a working, tested, deployable application with real API integrations, appropriate data provenance, persistent state, functional controls and a compelling presentation.

Preserve all existing functionality unless a change is demonstrably necessary.

